# DIHEDRAL (proper): ghost-ghost springs, one ring group per real AMBER
# Fourier harmonic of each covered chi1-4 (family SIDECHAIN) and phi/psi
# (family BACKBONE) axis -- see doc/BondedForceFieldSprings.md. dc_offset
# (kJ.mol-1) is this spring's share of its axis's exact energy correction
